). This chart runs from Jan 13, 2021 to May 21, 2021.","setup":"The stock rose about 38% in the three months before the base. It then formed a base for about 7 weeks, peaking at $213.80 and pulling back 15% at its deepest. Daily price ranges stayed about the same width through the base.","outcome":"On Apr 5, 2021 it closed at $215.28, its first close above the base high of $213.80. Volume that day was 766K shares, 1.18x the prior 10-day average of 648K. It didn't hold. By Apr 9, 2021 it had closed below the breakout level three days running, and the chart ends at $183.90.","lesson":"This is an example of a false breakout. Volume on the breakout day was light, and that tell was visible before the move fell apart. Cutting it early was a good read."}}